      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-25T19:06:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Its not clear to me why you need the .align directives.  All of the preceeding instructions must be 2-byte aligned anyway, and there isn\u0027t a 1-byte NOP instruction for the assembler to insert if it needed to do so.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 189,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 189,
        "endChar": 7
      },
      "revId": "9651a66f3976b46ec3f2b0bff3848d60982fc551",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0772751e_69885531",
        "filename": "core/nds32/__divdi3.S",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 189,
      "author": {
        "id": 1153134
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-29T10:38:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NDS32 CPU supports 16-bit/32-bit mixed-length instruction set.\nWe will get an extra penalty (latency) under this condition:\nUnaligned 32-bit instruction fetch after pipeline flushes (redirect or resume events).\n\nSo we won’t get the extra latency if this label is word-aligned here.",
      "parentUuid": "69ab7c7f_052c4af7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 189,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 189,
        "endChar": 7
      },
      "revId": "9651a66f3976b46ec3f2b0bff3848d60982fc551",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "014e3c25_90083020",
        "filename": "core/nds32/__divdi3.S",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 189,
      "author": {
        "id": 1284593
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-29T21:12:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like the .align directive has platform-dependent behavior.  On some platforms (including x86), it is a number of bytes, and on others (including ARM) it is a power of two.\n\nPlease double-check GNU GAS to see if it is treating .align as a power-of-two (like .p2align) or as a number of bytes (like .balign) on the NDS32 platform.\n\nSee also https://sourceware.org/binutils/docs/as/Align.html#Align",
      "parentUuid": "0772751e_69885531",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 189,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 189,
        "endChar": 7
      },
      "revId": "9651a66f3976b46ec3f2b0bff3848d60982fc551",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "12c5f31d_12857050",
        "filename": "core/nds32/__divdi3.S",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 189,
